{"code":"PP14","wikidata":"Q13021812","wikipedia":{"en":"Wong Sawang MRT station","th":"สถานีวงศ์สว่าง"},"summary":{"en":"Wong Sawang station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Purple Line. The station opened on 6 August 2016 and is located on Bangkok-Nonthaburi road, near its intersection with Wong Sawang Road in Bangkok. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีวงศ์สว่าง เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าลอยฟ้าในเส้นทางสายรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายฉลองรัชธรรม ตั้งอยู่เหนือถนนกรุงเทพฯ-นนทบุรีในพื้นที่เขตบางซื่อ กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2016-08-06","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/201701_Wong_Sawang_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Wong_Sawang_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Wong_Sawang_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/201701_Concourse_of_Wong_Sawang_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Concourse_of_Wong_Sawang_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Concourse_of_Wong_Sawang_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Wong_Sawang_Station_20230709-1.jpg/960px-Wong_Sawang_Station_20230709-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wong_Sawang_Station_20230709-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Wong_Sawang_Station_20230709-2.jpg/960px-Wong_Sawang_Station_20230709-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wong_Sawang_Station_20230709-2.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wiki